<title>USA: AmerUs Life Holdings Inc Q2 full results.</title>
<headline>AmerUs Life Holdings Inc Q2 full results.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>OPERATING EARNINGS</p>
<p>				 Six Months Ended  Three Months Ended</p>
<p> ($ in thousands, except	    June 30	     June 30</p>
<p>  per share amounts)	    1997     1996     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net income		     29,022   56,461   14,442   11,671</p>
<p>Net realized (gains)</p>
