<p>Operating Earnings per</p>
<p> common share		     1.03	.87	.53	.47</p>
<p>NOTE: (A) Represents realized gains or losses on investments less  portion of amortization of deferred policy acquisition costs adjusted  for income taxes. (B) Represents mutual life insurance co equity add-on  tax, which applicable only to mutual life insurance cos and which  co believes will not be applicable to co after June 30, 1996 due to  conversion into stock co. (C) Represents costs directly related to  reorganization. (D) Costs associated with forming joint venture with  Ameritas Life Insurance Corp.</p>
